],"The upright shall see and rejoice; and all iniquity shall stop her mouth."],["43",[["Τίς",39,150],["σοφὸς",324,16],["καὶ",2,8],["φυλάξει",125,120],["ταῦτα",16,248],["καὶ",2,8],["συνήσει",606,120],["τὰ",1,42],["ἐλέη",183,43],["τοῦ",1,30],["Κυρίου",7,21]],"Who is wise, and will observe these things, and understand the mercies of the Lord?"]]